## Plan de Rutas (resumen)

| Método | URI | Controlador | Middleware |
|--------|-----|-------------|------------|
| GET | `/` | `HomeController` | — |
| GET/POST | `/register` | `Auth\RegisterController` | `guest` |
| GET/POST | `/login` | `Auth\LoginController` | `guest` |
| POST | `/logout` | `Auth\LogoutController` | `auth` |
| GET | `/jugadas` | `JugadaController@index` | `auth` |
| GET | `/jugadas/crear` | `JugadaController@create` | `auth` |
| POST | `/jugadas` | `JugadaController@store` | `auth` |
| GET | `/jugadas/{id}/pdf` | `JugadaController@downloadPdf` | `auth` |
| GET | `/admin` | `Admin\DashboardController` | `auth:admin` |
| PATCH | `/admin/jugadas/{id}/estado` | `Admin\JugadaAdminController@update` | `auth:admin` |
| POST | `/admin/jugadas/{id}/reenviar` | `Admin\JugadaAdminController@reenviarNotificacion` | `auth:admin` |
| DELETE | `/admin/limpiar` | `Admin\JugadaAdminController@limpiarBaseDatos` | `auth:admin` |
| GET/PUT | `/admin/precios/{id}` | `Admin\PrecioController` | `auth:admin` |

